Target-tier tests. One image; cases are selected by name over the console.

    idf.py -C testing/target set-target esp32c3
    idf.py -C testing/target build
    # flash the coldflash set to the DUT slot, then over the console:
    run TS-014      one case
    run all         every case
    list            what is here

Output contract, which the bench harness relies on:
    RESULT <id> PASS|FAIL  <detail>
    DONE <n> checks        <- positive completion marker; absence means a crash
